# ========================================================
# TMLogistx Project Master Environment Guide
# ========================================================
# TMLogistx has three distinct components sharing a single centralized backend:
#
# 1. /server/.env       -> Node.js + Express + Neon PostgreSQL API & WebSockets
# 2. /web-app/.env      -> React + Vite + Redux Toolkit + Tailwind CSS Management Portal
# 3. /mobile-app/.env   -> React Native / Expo Staff & Driver Mobile Apps
#
# See the respective directories for their localized .env configuration.
